</div><p style="font: 14pt/139% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><b>Audit Committee Pre-Approval Policies and Procedures</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">At its regularly scheduled and special meetings
or by written consent, the Audit Committee considers and pre-approves any audit and non-audit services to be performed by the Company&#8217;s
independent accountants. On July 25, 2021, the Audit Committee adopted its pre-approval policies and procedures. Since that date, there
have been no audit or non-audit services rendered by the Company&#8217;s principal accountants that were not pre-approved.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p><div>

