pursuant to the Microvast Holdings, Inc. 2021 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2021 Plan&#8221;). The terms of the 2025 RSUs and 2025
PSUs are summarized in &#8220;Elements of Executive Compensation&#8212;Long-Term Incentives&#8221; above. The assumptions made when calculating
the amounts reported are found in Not<span style="background-color: white">e&#160;20</span>, &#8220;Share-Based Payment&#8221; to our
consolidated financial statements included in Part II, Item 8 of the Annual Report. Assuming maximum level of performance, the aggregate
grant date values of the RSUs and PSUs are as follows:</span></td></tr></table><div>

